      "writtenOn": "2025-10-07T17:30:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this feasible to do with merge scripts?\nIt looks like \"Hash testcases\" step here https://ci.chromium.org/ui/p/dawn/builders/ci/cron-linux-clang-rel-x64/b8701714697855667057/overview merges unittests and end2end tests, I don\u0027t think merge scripts have access to another step\u0027s results.",
      "revId": "1b5742e6c0242c1a5bc6286399ede7bb79878a84",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
